SUMMARY:Breath Medicine: Breathwork at HapBE Valley
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nA grounded\, nature-immersed breathwork e
 xperience designed to help you slow down\, reset your system\, and breathe
  a little easier. Held at the beautiful HapBE Valley Farm in Leicester. **
 This is a collaborative $20 paid event\, please [LEARN MORE & REGISTER HER
 E.](https://momence.com/HapBE-Valley-Equine-%26-Wellness-Farm/Breath-Medic
 ine%3A-Breathwork-at-HapBE-Valley/131421025?skipPreview=true)**
