SUMMARY:Community Night at The Light Center Dome
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**The UR Light Center Dome will be open t
 he night of Saturday\, May 9.**\n\n*Interested in a full Stars and Sound H
 ealing immersion? Get your tickets to the 3:00-5:00PM [StarSounds Event.](
 https://urlight.org/events/star-sounds-050926/) Pack a picnic dinner\, exp
 lore the hiking paths\, and stay for Night at the Dome!*\n\nMembers of the
  community are invited to join hosts\, Liam and Michelle\, along with spec
 ial guest\, Evolutionary Astrologer & Sound Alchemist David Heiss\, to cre
 ate a Heart Centered Unity Field.\nCome out and enjoy an evening in the Do
 me and meet with other friends of the Light Center. This is a “free flow
 ” event with opportunities to meet others of like mind\, meditate/ground
 /center\, intention setting\, music\, Heart Centered Unity Field\, chakra 
 light room sessions and a moonlight walk in the labyrinth.\n\n**This is a 
 free event open to all.** Love offerings/donations are accepted to benefit
  The Light Center and United Research. Bring your energy and water bottle.
 \n\n* Doors open\, meet\, greet\, mingle and explore (6:00-6:30)\n* Commun
 ity Welcoming/Opening and Intention Setting\n* Heart Centered Unity Field 
 & Playing with StarSounds\n* Light Room Sessions and Candlelight Labyrinth
  walks\n\n*\\*\\*All times subject to change and flow freely as the night 
 progresses\\*\\**\nVisit [UR Light Website](https://urlight.org/events/nig
 ht-at-the-dome-050926/) to learn more.
